  "reference": "Uumama 34",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "34",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "34",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya toko Dina, intalti Yakobofi Lea, imaltu gara nad'eeni gosa Kanaani d'at'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba gurbaani toko, ka Shekemu jed'ani, ka ilma namicha gudda lafa suni, ka gosa Hivi, ka Hamori jed'ani, isi arge jennaani qabe buufate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo intalti sunini guddo mid'aadi arge jennaani jaalate isi dubbifate, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan abbaani jed'e, Anini aka atini intala Yakobo na kad'attu fed'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobooni aka intala isaa fafeesani d'agaye, ammo maro ijoolleeni isaa ala tikha jirtuufi woma tokole tolchu dide, haga isiini galtuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbaani Shekemu Hamoriini Yakobooni haasau d'aqe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijoolleeni Yakobo ala galte waan hammaate d'ageennaani aka hama rifatte guddo dallante, waan Shekemuuni intala worra buufate gosa Israeli miid'eefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamoriini waan Yakobooni jed'e, Gurbaani kiyya Shekemuuni ya guddo intala tante jaalate, anini si kad'ad'a intala naa kenni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koota, wold'ageenna, aka nu dubra teesani fuune, isanileeni dubra teenna fuutani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba isanileeni lafa teenna keesa fulluma feetani nagayaani teetani, aka feetani dilaaltani horile horattani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shekemuuni waan abba Dinatiifi oboleyaani isiitiini jed'e, Waan kana naa tolcha, duuba anileeni waan isani feetani isanii tolcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan feetani nati himad'a, ammalle hori qarat'a ka anini isanii baasu, haguma feetani nati himad'a; anini waan isani feetani ch'ufa isanii kenna, yo isani intala teesani ch'alla nati gurgurtani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilmaani Yakobo, waan Shekemuuni oboleeti worra Dina fafeeseefi, Shekemufi abba isaa Hamori sobde lafaa balleesite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan worri jed'eeni, Oboleeti teenna nami qabanqaba inqabatini imfuud'u; sunini nuu waan ch'eeraati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo isani qabanqaba qabattani aka keenna taatani ch'alla intala teenna fuutani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuleeni teesani fuuna. Nu woluma keesa qubanne nama takaa taana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo isani dubbi teenna diddani qabanqaba qabachu baattani, nu intala teenna fud'anne isani iraa godaanna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamorifi gurbaani isaa Shekemuuni dubbi tana maachani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "duuba gurbaani hojuma suni gale, waan intala Yakobo jaalateefi, waan Tahi jed'aniini ch'ufa tahe. Inni worra isaani keesa guddo gurra qaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamorifi ilmi isaa Shekemuuni fulla fullo dira suni d'aqani waan biyyaani jed'ani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'iiro, worri kuni worra nagayaati, ha lafa teenna keesa taani fulla fed'ani godaanani. Lafti ballo, wolti nuu geeti. Koota, dubra worra fuune, worrileeni ha teenna fuud'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoi worri kuni nu woliini tae nu worra taka taanu, yo nuleeni, aka worra, nama d'iira ch'ufa, qabanqaba qamnuufi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hori worraatifi wonti worri qabu ch'ufti teenna intaatu? Koota, wold'ageenna, aka worri nu woliini tau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri lafa suni ch'ufti dubbi Hamoritiifi gurba isaa gula gale, nama worra ka d'iira ch'ufa qabanqaba qabani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya sadeeso, ato madaani kolaante jiitu, ilmaani Yakobo ta oboleyaani Dina lama, Simeonifi Lawiini, goraade guuratte d'ossaani dira suni duudde, nama d'iira ch'ufa fit'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shekemufi abba isaale. Duuba Dina mana Shekemu keesaa fuud'ani itiini d'aabatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami d'iira ch'ufti hobaanaani ilmaani Yakobo dachaate dira suni soqatte, waan ch'ufa guuratte, aka haalo oboleeti worra ta fafeesani baaftu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ree, looni, harrefi waan dirafi oobru keesati argani ch'ufa fud'atani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan worri qabu ch'ufa fud'atani, nad'eenifi ijoolle boojiani, waan mana keesati argani ch'ufa itiini d'aabatani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:29"
          },
